  ### 1. Prerequisites (Install Tools)                                       
                                                                             
  If you haven't installed Terraform and the AWS CLI yet (Homebrew is        
  available on your Mac):                                                    
                                                                             
    # Install Terraform & AWS CLI                                            
    brew tap hashicorp/tap                                                   
    brew install hashicorp/tap/terraform                                     
    brew install awscli                                                      
                                                                             
  Configure your AWS credentials:                                            
                                                                             
    aws configure                                                            
  ──────                                                                     
  ### 2. Configure Variables                                                 
                                                                             
  Create your local variable configuration from the example template:        
                                                                             
    cp terraform.tfvars.example terraform.tfvars                             
                                                                             
  (Edit terraform.tfvars to set your desired region, CIDRs, database port,   
  and whether to use single_nat_gateway = true for dev/cost-saving or false  
  for HA production.)                                                        
  ──────                                                                     
  ### 3. Core Terraform Workflow                                             
                                                                             
  Run these commands inside /Users/hasithadhananjaya/Desktop/Secure Cloud    
  Network:                                                                   
                                                                             
    # Initialize the working directory and download the AWS provider         
    terraform init                                                           
                                                                             
    # Check code formatting                                                  
    terraform fmt -check                                                     
                                                                             
    # Validate configuration syntax and parameters                           
    terraform validate                                                       
                                                                             
    # Preview changes before provisioning                                    
    terraform plan                                                           
                                                                             
    # Deploy the infrastructure to AWS                                       
    terraform apply                                                          
  ──────                                                                     
  ### 4. Inspecting Outputs & State                                          
                                                                             
  After applying, view the provisioned resource IDs (VPC ID, subnet IDs,     
  security groups):                                                          
                                                                             
    # View all output variables defined in outputs.tf                        
    terraform output                                                         
                                                                             
    # View a specific output in JSON format                                  
    terraform output -json                                                   
                                                                             
    # List all tracked resources in state                                    
    terraform state list                                                     
  ──────                                                                     
  ### 5. Cleanup & Teardown                                                  
                                                                             
  To delete all provisioned AWS resources and avoid ongoing AWS charges:     
                                                                             
    terraform destroy                                                        

